WEBVTT

00:34:28.371 --> 00:34:35.371
If you have any desire to do this,
do it because it is walking,

00:34:35.371 --> 00:34:39.746
especially walking along way for
many days on end day after day.

00:34:40.038 --> 00:34:44.413
It's it's it's a deeply, deeply
challenging thing.

00:34:44.413 --> 00:34:47.704
So you get you you gain your
sense of your own strength

00:34:47.704 --> 00:34:53.621
and your own ability to endure difficulty,
monotony, pain.

00:34:54.371 --> 00:34:57.246
And of course, what happens
on the outside,

00:34:57.246 --> 00:34:59.538
one foot in front of the other
in front of the other,

00:34:59.746 --> 00:35:03.663
also happens on the inside that, you know,
turns out for me, you know,